---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How Accbase Advisory collects, uses and protects personal information submitted through this website.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" lede="Last updated: replace with your publication date." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p><strong>This is a starting draft, not legal advice.</strong> Have it reviewed by a qualified professional before you publish, and replace this notice.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit the contact form we collect the name, email address, company name and any details you choose to include. We also collect standard server logs and, where enabled, privacy-respecting analytics data about page visits.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use the information you submit to respond to your enquiry, arrange a call and prepare a scope of work. We do not sell your information, and we do not share it with third parties except service providers who help us operate this website and our email.</p>
      <h2>Client financial data</h2>
      <p>Financial data belonging to engaged clients is handled under a separate engagement agreement and non-disclosure agreement, not under this policy.</p>
      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>Enquiry records are retained for as long as needed to respond and for a reasonable period afterwards, then deleted.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Write to info@accbaseadvisory.com and we will respond within 30 days.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:info@accbaseadvisory.com">info@accbaseadvisory.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
